            <h2>What Data We Collect and Why We Collect It</h2>
            <p>
                As a web-based application, CRT gathers certain browser-based information automatically and stores it in log files. This may include:
            </p>
            <ul class="force-list">
                <li>Your browser type and version.</li>
                <li>Your IP address.</li>
                <li>Your language preferences.</li>
                <li>Screen resolution and device display settings.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                This information does not identify individual users and is used to analyze trends, administer the app, track user movements, and gather demographic information to improve the service.
            </p>

            <h2>Personally Identifiable Information</h2>
            <p>
                When you use CRT, we may request personally identifiable information, such as:
            </p>
            <ul class="force-list">
                <li>Your first and last name.</li>
                <li>Your email address.</li>
                <li>Account preferences and settings.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                This information is used to provide the service, respond to inquiries, and improve the application. You may review and update your information in the settings section of the app. Deleting your information may result in cancellation of your account.
            </p>

            <h2>Use of Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
            <p>
                CRT may use browser-based storage mechanisms, such as cookies or local storage, to:
            </p>
            <ul class="force-list">
                <li>Remember your login information.</li>
                <li>Save app settings and preferences.</li>
                <li>Improve the app's functionality and user experience.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Use of Information</h2>
            <p>
                We use collected information to:
            </p>
            <ul class="force-list">
                <li>Provide, manage, and improve the app's functionality.</li>
                <li>Communicate with users about updates or relevant information.</li>
                <li>Ensure compliance with legal obligations.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Storage and Security of Information</h2>
            <p>
                CRT operates using secure data practices, including:
            </p>
            <ul class="force-list">
                <li>Secure connections (e.g., HTTPS) for data transmission.</li>
                <li>Industry-standard encryption to protect data stored locally or on our servers.</li>
                <li>Regular reviews of security measures to ensure protection.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Access Permissions</h2>
            <p>
                CRT may request certain permissions from your browser, such as:
            </p>
            <ul class="force-list">
                <li>Geolocation access for location-based risk analysis (if applicable).</li>
                <li>Notification permissions for alerts and updates.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                These permissions are optional, and you may revoke them through your browser settings.
            </p>

            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>
                If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at: <strong>support@catalystrisktool.com</strong>.
            </p>
